## Highlights
Milk toxicity and materials for analysing are introduced.   
Metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) materials as electrochemical and luminescence analysis of milk contaminants are discussed.   
Fabrication, analytical performances, and signal change insights are studied. Challenges, key findings, outcomes, and future trends in MOF as milk monitoring biosensors are discussed.
